The wave tank (`src/client/bg-wake.ts`) is original to this package.

The `dsh-ascii-ocean` plugin was read as a behaviour reference only. Its
repository has no licence text (the LICENSE file is 12 bytes), so no code from
it is copied here.

The shape-aware glyph chart in `src/client/bg-ascii.ts` (`SHAPE_EXTRAS`,
`buildShapeChart` and the `level × 5 + direction` lookup) adapts the algorithm
described in Alex Harri Jónsson's "ASCII characters are not pixels" and the MIT
`glyph-graphics` implementation:

